findings.remediation:
Add a maintenance_update_policy block to google_alloydb_cluster.main, ideally parameterised alongside the backup schedule (see HOLDEN_BP_003):

  maintenance_update_policy {
    maintenance_windows {
      day = "SUNDAY"
      start_time {
        hours   = 3
        minutes = 0
        seconds = 0
        nanos   = 0
      }
    }
  }

Pick a window that does not collide with the 02:00 backup window.

Add a var.database_flags map (default {}) and merge it over the module's baseline so callers can extend and override:

  database_flags = merge({
    "alloydb.enable_pgaudit"      = "on"
    "pgaudit.log"                 = "ddl,role,write"
    "password.enforce_complexity" = "on"
  }, var.database_flags)

findings.fix:
automated_backup_policy {
  location      = var.location
  backup_window = var.backup_window
  enabled       = true

  weekly_schedule {
    days_of_week = var.backup_days_of_week

    start_times {
      hours   = var.backup_start_hour
      minutes = 0
      seconds = 0
      nanos   = 0
    }
  }

  quantity_based_retention {
    count = var.backup_retention_count
  }

  encryption_config {
    kms_key_name = var.kms_key_name
  }
}

